          "position": 4,
          "id": "cb37e0ac-ad68-40e5-9910-9bff99e073d0"
        },
        {
          "term": "Intimacy vs Isolation",
          "kind": "standard",
          "definition": "Young adulthood, ages 18 to 40. People form deep relationships and connections; difficulty connecting may lead to loneliness.",
