          "position": 5,
          "id": "636ababa-dcbd-49eb-ae16-63ec21ab439b"
        },
        {
          "term": "Generativity vs Stagnation",
          "kind": "standard",
          "definition": "Middle adulthood, ages 40 to 65. Adults contribute to society and help others; lack of purpose may cause feelings of being stuck.",
